<title>USA: Dain Bosworth Inc wins $47 mln Oklahoma City, Okla. GOs. [CORRECTED 15:54 GMT]</title>
<headline>Dain Bosworth Inc wins $47 mln Oklahoma City, Okla. GOs. [CORRECTED 15:54 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects in headline and throughout to Dain Bosworth Inc from Smith Barney)</p>
<p>Dain Bosworth Inc said Tuesday it won $47.5 million of Oklahoma City, Okla., general obligation bonds, Series 1997, with a true interest cost (TIC) of 5.14 percent.</p>
